id: arcosian-genes-survivor
name: Genetic Survivor
order: 1
optionOf: arcosian-genes
optionEffect: 4
# Artificial Warrior's Option chosen: this one.
follows: genetic-survivor
description: >
  If your Plating has its Break Value reduced, gain an Adaptation Point.
text: >
  Genetic Survivor [Triggered]: If your Plating has its Break Value reduced, gain an Adaptation Point.

---

# Your Natural Armor's Break Value lowered, however (plating-reduced). Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/plating-reduced, effect 4]
adaptation.stacks += 1;
